	dprr:hasNoteText "He was expelled by the censors from the Senate in 174 (Liv. 41.27.2, with praenomen L.; Vell. 1.10.6, with praenomen Cn.; Val. Max. 2.7.5, with L.; Frontin. Str. 4.1.32, no praenomen). On the identification, see MRR 1.391, note 3.\r\n" .
